                "description": "Milano Lever with Regular Rose - The Milano Lever with Regular Rose is wonderfully retro lever that will add a sense of style to any room of your home. Although this leverset has a contemporary feel, it still manages to have an elegance that keeps it rooted in traditional beauty. The Milano Lever with Regular Rosette with fit 1-3/8 inch to 2-1/4 inch doors with a 2-3/8 inch or a 2-3/4 inch backset.",
                "keywords": "Milano Leverset with Round Roses, Emtek MILANO-REG, Milano Lever with Regular Roses, EMT-MILANO-REG, Emtek Milano lever, emtek regular rose, contemporary levers, modern levers, Modern Milano Lever with Round Roses,  Emtek Milano Lever with Regular Round Rosettes, EMT-8050M, Emtek 8100M, Emtek 8200M, Emtek 8050M, Retro Milano Lever with Round Rose,"
